# Caddy configuration lives in config/caddy/.
#
#   config/caddy/Caddyfile                          — global config (deploy to /etc/caddy/Caddyfile)
#   config/caddy/sites/staging.left-wordle.com      — staging site include
#   config/caddy/sites/production.left-wordle.com   — production site include
#
# Both site includes are tracked here for reference, but neither is deployed
# automatically by Capistrano -- Caddy config changes on paula-poundstone are
# applied by hand (validate, then reload/restart). Keep these files in sync
# with whatever's actually live after making a manual change.
